            <!-- STAGE 03 to 16: Dynamic Generation of Locked Quest Cards in JS, 
                 or HTML hardcoded structure below for static resilience -->

            <!-- JavaScript will render the remaining 14 locked stages dynamically to keep code clean, 
                 or we fall back to pre-rendered placeholders -->
